== Reminders

- *Mean* = (sum of all values) $div$ (number of values)
- *Median* = the middle value when the data are in order. With an even number of values, take the mean of the two middle values.
- *Mode* = the value that occurs most often. There can be more than one mode, or none.
- *Range* = largest value $-$ smallest value

